</div><div class="bde-f-text-506-156 bde-f-text">
<p>Edgecombe’s net worth is estimated at around <strong>$9.11m</strong>, taken from his <strong>$22.77m</strong> in career earnings. No outlet publishes a figure for him.</p>
<p>He played one season at Baylor and Philadelphia took him third in 2025, a month before he turned 20.</p>

