<script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/vj-edgecombe/#faq","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/vj-edgecombe/"},"mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Is VJ Edgecombe’s Salary at Philadelphia?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Edgecombe earns $11.66m in 2026-27, fourth at Philadelphia and the second year of his rookie contract. It rises from $11.11m last season. His career earnings come to $22.77m across two seasons, both at Philadelphia. The salary is 5.63% of the club’s $207.19m payroll."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What’s Next for VJ Edgecombe Beyond 2026?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Philadelphia exercised the 2027-28 club option, worth $12.22m, on October 19, 2026. The 2028-29 season is a club option worth $15.45m with a deadline of October 31, 2027. Of the $50.44m total, $34.99m is now guaranteed."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Does VJ Edgecombe Earn Over Time?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A $11.66m season is hard to picture, so here's what it comes to over smaller stretches of time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What Are the Terms of VJ Edgecombe’s Contract?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Edgecombe signed the rookie scale with Philadelphia in 2025, four years and $50.44m of which $34.99m is now guaranteed. Philadelphia exercised the club option on 2027-28, worth $12.22m, on October 19, 2026. The 2028-29 season is a club option with a deadline of October 31, 2027, and he would reach restricted free agency in 2029 at 23."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What Is VJ Edgecombe’s Net Worth?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Edgecombe’s net worth is estimated at around $9.11m, taken from his $22.77m in career earnings. No outlet publishes a figure for him. He played one season at Baylor and Philadelphia took him third in 2025, a month before he turned 20."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why Do the 76ers Pay VJ Edgecombe Rookie Money?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Edgecombe is paid $11.66m because the rookie scale pays by draft position, and the third pick is near the top of it. At 21 he is the second youngest player Philadelphia is paying."}}]}</script>
